OL,3,GNEWSAEngland's first biker safety
OL,4,Amarkings introduced
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew road markings and signs designed to
OL,7,Fhelp motorcyclists navigate bends more
OL,8,Fsafely have been introduced in England
OL,9,Ffor the first time.
OL,11,FThe new measures are on the B6015
OL,12,FWoodhead Road at Devil's Elbow, near
OL,13,FGlossop, and the A6, between Buxton and
OL,14,FBakewell, in Derbyshire.
OL,16,FThe scheme is being delivered by
OL,17,FDerbyshire County Council, Derbyshire
OL,18,FConstabulary and National Highways.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
